OL,3,GNEWSADolphin given first aid after
OL,4,Abecoming stranded on beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA distressed dolphin was given first
OL,7,Faid after it became stranded on a
OL,8,Fremote area of a beach in south Wales.
OL,10,FThe male common dolphin was looked
OL,11,Fafter, and returned to the sea, by
OL,12,Fmarine mammal medics, following calls
OL,13,Ffrom concerned members of the public to
OL,14,Fthe British Divers Marine Life Rescue
OL,15,F(BDMLR).
OL,17,FWith assistance from the National Trust
OL,18,Fand officers from HM Coastguard
OL,19,FRhossili, medics were able to assist
OL,20,Fthe animal which was located in a
OL,21,F"particularly remote area" on the Gower
OL,22,FPeninsula.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
